<!-- ═══ 01 · THE PROBLEM ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">01 / The problem</span>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">Where it breaks</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start">
      <h2 class="section-h2 reveal">Five vendors<br/>who don't talk to each other.</h2>
      <div class="reveal reveal-1 space-y-4 max-w-xl">
        <p class="lede">Your web designer is waiting on photos from the photographer, the social media agency doesn't know about the new service page, and IT knows about none of it.</p>
        <p class="lede">You're the one coordinating all of it — in the evening, between two appointments.</p>
        <p class="evidence text-[17px] leading-snug">We solve this differently: one team, one point of contact, coordinated trades.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 02 · THE THREE CLUSTERS ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
