<!-- ═══ 03 · THE AIVANCE PRINCIPLE — the chain of evidence ═══ -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">04 / The principle</span>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">From claim to proof</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start mb-16">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="section-h2 mb-5">Three promises —<br/>each with proof.</h2>
        <p class="lede max-w-md">Promises are cheap. That's why every claim here is backed by a number, a document or a page where you can read it yourself. On this site, amber marks one thing only: what is proven.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="chain reveal reveal-1">
        <div class="chain-row">
          <span class="chain-label">Claim</span>
          <span class="chain-question">“We tell you exactly when your system goes live.”</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chain-row">
          <span class="chain-label">Check</span>
          <span class="chain-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
          <span class="chain-meta">3 / 3 projects</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chain-row top">
          <span class="chain-label is-amber">Proven</span>
          <span class="chain-answer evidence">Knowledge systems have gone live in 17 days on average.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chain-row top">
          <span class="chain-label">Sources</span>
          <div class="chain-sources">
            <a href="/en/projekte/onboarding-mittelstand/" class="chain-source">
              <span class="chain-num">1</span>
              <span class="chain-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="chain-file">projekte/onboarding-mittelstand</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/en/leistungen/wissenssysteme/" class="chain-source">
              <span class="chain-num">2</span>
              <span class="chain-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="chain-file">leistungen/wissenssysteme</span>
            </a>
            <div class="chain-source">
              <span class="chain-num empty">3</span>
              <span class="chain-rule empty" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="chain-file muted">no further evidence</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 border border-line reveal">
      <div class="p-7 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-line flex flex-col">
        <span class="eyebrow mb-5 text-[11px]">Data protection</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-5">Hosting in Germany and the EU, DPA under Art. 28 GDPR, no model training on your data. Also built for professionals bound by confidentiality law.</p>
        <a href="/en/data-security/" class="mono text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-ink hover:text-amber transition-colors mt-auto">See all evidence →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="p-7 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-line flex flex-col">
        <span class="eyebrow mb-5 text-[11px]">Quality</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-5">Case studies with before-and-after numbers, a defined process with named phases, and one dedicated contact — not an anonymous “team”.</p>
        <a href="/en/projekte/" class="mono text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-ink hover:text-amber transition-colors mt-auto">See results →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="p-7 flex flex-col">
        <span class="eyebrow mb-5 text-[11px]">Speed</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-5">Every service has its own honest timeline — knowledge systems have gone live in 17 days on average, a website realistically takes 4–6 weeks.</p>
        <a href="/en/leistungen/" class="mono text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-ink hover:text-amber transition-colors mt-auto">Timelines per service →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 04 · INDUSTRY SELECTOR ═══ -->
