<!-- ═══ 08 · FAQ ═══ -->
{% set homeFaqEn = [
  { q: "What does AIVANCE actually do — agency or software vendor?", a: "Both, and that's the point: we're a digital agency that designs (website, photo, social media) and builds (software, automation). You get no hand-off to subcontractors — one team implements both." },
  { q: "Why book website, photography and automation with one provider?", a: "Because the disciplines depend on each other: the website needs the photos, automation needs the website's form data, social media needs both. With separate vendors you coordinate those dependencies yourself — with us that step disappears." },
  { q: "What does a project cost?", a: "It depends on scope and service area — a website costs differently than a knowledge system integrated with your line-of-business software. What's fixed: the introductory call and process review are free, after that you get a fixed-price offer for one clearly scoped first step. No open-ended hourly billing." },
  { q: "How long does implementation take?", a: "That varies by service, and we state it per service: knowledge systems have gone live in 17 days on average, a website realistically takes 4–6 weeks, a voice agent pilot 2–4 weeks. You get the concrete date in the first project week." },
  { q: "Where is my data stored and who has access?", a: "On servers in Germany (Hetzner) or the EU (AWS eu-central-1) — for US-based clients, on US servers. Access is governed by a data processing agreement under Art. 28 GDPR, and your data is never used for AI model training. Full details on our Data Security page." },
  { q: "Do you work with professionals bound by confidentiality law (doctors, tax advisors)?", a: "Yes. For medical practices and tax firms, specific confidentiality statutes apply — we bring the written confidentiality commitment and data processing agreement, and document safeguards for your own compliance obligations." },
  { q: "What happens after go-live?", a: "You decide: a one-time handover with documentation, or ongoing support with agreed response times and a dedicated contact. Most clients choose ongoing support — you're not locked into it." }
] %}
<section id="faq" class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">09 / FAQ</span>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">{{ homeFaqEn | length }} questions</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] gap-10 md:gap-16 items-start">
      <h2 class="section-h2 reveal">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="reveal reveal-1 border-t border-line">
        {% for item in homeFaqEn %}
        <div class="border-b border-line">
          <button type="button" data-faq-toggle aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left py-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
            <span class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-tight">{{ item.q }}</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon w-4 h-4 text-ink-muted flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body hidden pb-6 pr-10"><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">{{ item.a }}</p></div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

